maluos-firstboot (0.1.8) resolute; urgency=medium

  * maluctl update auto (Phase 12 slice 7, the Upgrade Manager's switches):
    automatic updates on|off, set security|maluos|mozilla on|off, reboot
    on|off [--at HH:MM]. Written as two drop-ins beside the shipped policy
    (53maluos-auto, 54maluos-origins) and a state file naming who changed
    what and when; the policy file is never edited and every switch at its
    default removes the drop-ins. `status` reports an off switch with its
    date and author. A polkit action (com.maluos.admin, for pkexec maluctl,
    administrator authentication kept per session) lets the desktop call
    `pkexec maluctl update auto …`.

